<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa's Sowits cautions in talks.</title>
<headline>S.Africa's Sowits cautions in talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African mine Southern Witwatersrand Exploration Co Ltd (Sowits) said on Friday that it was involved in talks, which if successful, may have an effect on its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their sharedealings.</p>
<p>No further details were given in the brief announcement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
